      "job_title_in_post": "Vacancy: 041764 - Senior Accountant - Internal Competition Contract: Specified Purpose up to 12 months Salary: Administrative Officer salary scale: €61,217 - €79,584 (Based on rates effective 1 June 2026) SETU is seeking an experienced Senior Accountant to join our Team in building a University for the Region. We are seeking ambitious, energetic and enthusiastic professionals who want to be part of this exciting opportunity. The SETU Finance Department is currently engaged in a transformation to enable it to meet the demands of a growing University and is building a unified Finance Department across all Campus The Senior Accountant will provide a professional and comprehensive service in the delivery of the objectives of the Finance department across SETU. We are seeking individuals who possess excellent technical skills, strong interpersonal skills, organisational abilities, vision and leadership, and who will play a key role in delivering on our strategy. This competition is open to internal staff members at SETU only. SETU is an equal opportunities employer. #SETU",
